{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746770/extras/synergies.gif?t=1747941955\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the demo version of\u00a0<i>Negative Space.</i>\u00a0<i>Negative Space\u00a0</i>is a <strong>deckbuilder</strong> without traditional combat. Instead, you\u2019ll build a synergistic crew to maximize their effort output, navigate uncharted planets, weather unpredictable crises, and capitalize on timely boons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746770/extras/overworld.gif?t=1747941955\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Assemble Your Crew</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you journey through the galaxy, you\u2019ll encounter a plethora of crewmembers\u2014each with a unique ability to add to your deck. By combining their effects with your chosen Captain, you'll need to explore distant planets and collect enough stars to complete your mission before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746770/extras/sun.png?t=1747941955\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Power of Trinkets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete difficult missions and you\u2019ll earn powerful trinkets that shape your strategy and evolve your playstyle. Their benefits may not be obvious at first glance, so you'll need to experiment. Unexpected combinations can propel your deck into the next universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746770/extras/shop.gif?t=1747941955\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 50 crew cards and 30 game-changing trinkets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Captains with unique abilities and signature trinkets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A full expedition with endless replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hand-crafted, colorful galaxy to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delightful and surprising chain reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical gameplay where every decision matters</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3746770?t=1747941955","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3746770?t=1747941955","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746770/d164daa3dc8ceaef3936d9eb28884f2ac907444c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747941955","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746770/d164daa3dc8ceaef3936d9eb28884f2ac907444c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747941955","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746770/extras/synergies.gif?t=1747941955\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is the demo version of\u00a0<i>Negative Space.</i>\u00a0<i>Negative Space\u00a0</i>is a <strong>deckbuilder</strong> without traditional combat. Instead, you\u2019ll build a synergistic crew to maximize their effort output, navigate uncharted planets, weather unpredictable crises, and capitalize on timely boons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746770/extras/overworld.gif?t=1747941955\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Assemble Your Crew</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you journey through the galaxy, you\u2019ll encounter a plethora of crewmembers\u2014each with a unique ability to add to your deck. By combining their effects with your chosen Captain, you'll need to explore distant planets and collect enough stars to complete your mission before time runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746770/extras/sun.png?t=1747941955\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Power of Trinkets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete difficult missions and you\u2019ll earn powerful trinkets that shape your strategy and evolve your playstyle. Their benefits may not be obvious at first glance, so you'll need to experiment. Unexpected combinations can propel your deck into the next universe!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746770/extras/shop.gif?t=1747941955\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 50 crew cards and 30 game-changing trinkets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Captains with unique abilities and signature trinkets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A full expedition with endless replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hand-crafted, colorful galaxy to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Delightful and surprising chain reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tactical gameplay where every decision matters</p></li></ul>","developers":["Tier 87 Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3624300","name":"Negative Space"},"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746770/817b7aaa8a14e8ac0a0c8096bb381106367c888f/header.jpg?t=1